the slope field is positive" :question/requires-calculator false :question/worked-solution "The factor $2$ is positive, so the sign of $2xy$ is the sign of $xy$. It is positive in quadrants I and III and negative in II and IV. Thus I and III are true, while II is false. Select **I and III only**."}]}
